<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 109,000 -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Thursday 109,000 -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings were 109,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 lower than the midsession Thursday.</p>
<p>				   Country		   Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    49.00 -50.00	   50.00 -51.00</p>
<p>few			48.50  50.50	   49.50  51.50</p>
<p>Sows:  450 dn steady-1.00 higher, 450 up mostly steady to 2.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  40.00 -43.50	   42.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    47.00 -50.00	   48.00 -51.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
